00318, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10fz2.jpg"}, {"id": 1700322, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10fz6.jpg"}, {"id": 1700323, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10fz7.jpg"}, {"id": 1700319, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10fz3.jpg"}, {"id": 1700320, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10fz4.jpg"}, {"id": 1700321, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10fz5.jpg"}, {"id": 1700324, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10fz8.jpg"}], "slug": "forsworn", "storyline": "Forsworn immerses players in a world shattered by a divine war between light and darkness. Resurrected by the so-called righteous, heroes must travel across a war-torn land where ancient secrets resurface and the morality of the divine is anything but certain. Uncover buried truths, challenge fate imposed by the gods, and rise again after every fall\u2013for in Forsworn, death is only the beginning.\n\nDrawing inspiration from the tactical combat in Divinity: Original Sin, Baldur\u2019s Gate 3, and XCOM, Forsworn challenges players with unforgiving battles that reward careful strategy. Heroes unlock mechanic-changing blessings, discover powerful items, and learn synergistic abilities that make coordinated party play essential to victory. Upgrades and items don\u2019t just raise stats\u2013they evolve abilities, unlock new mechanics, and shape entirely new playstyles each run.", "summary": "Step into a realm torn by divine conflict where every defeat is just another beginning in this rogue lite, turn-based tactics adventure where no hero fights alone. Build powerful synergies to overcome unforgiving battles and defy fate in a world controlled by the gods.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/forsworn", "videos": [{"id": 168782, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "6EKiKedlCgs", "url": "https://www.youtube.